<li>Anggota DPR RI (1987–1992)</li>
<li>Anggota MPR RI (1997–1999)</li>
<li>Gubernur Provinsi Nangroe Aceh Darussalam (2000–2004)</li>
</ul>
<h2>Riwayat Organisasi</h2>
<ul>
<li>Komandan Resimen Mahawarman Batalyon VI Detasemen ATPUT Bandung (1969–1971)</li>
<li>Ketua Umum HMI Cabang Bandung (1970–1971)</li>
<li>Ketua Biro Kaderisasi PB HMI (1971–1973)</li>
